(1531823, 202186, 7252, '<td valign="top">This is perhaps the most perfect photo for this challenge. Fast shutter to freeze the players but slow enough to get some blur on the ball. Nice brilliant colors. I''m a little torn on the composition. Part of me wants the lens pulled back so it''s not so tightly framed but the other part really enjoys the tightness because it allows you to see more of the facial expression. Overall extremely well done. I''m anxiously waiting to see which ribbon this takes.</td>', 'This is perhaps the most perfect photo for this challenge. Fast shutter to freeze the players but slow enough to get some blur on the ball. Nice brilliant colors. I''m a little torn on the composition. Part of me wants the lens pulled back so it''s not so tightly framed but the other part really enjoys the tightness because it allows you to see more of the facial expression. Overall extremely well done. I''m anxiously waiting to see which ribbon this takes.', '2005-07-13 02:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
