(1531933, 203154, 31720, '<td valign="top">The out-of-focus sand and rocks in the foreground is a distraction to me.  Having the second surfer in focus as well would have improved this picture as well.</td>', 'The out-of-focus sand and rocks in the foreground is a distraction to me.  Having the second surfer in focus as well would have improved this picture as well.', '2005-07-13 03:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
