(1532417, 202722, 15026, '<td valign="top">I don'' t really care for the angle at which you caught the tee floating in the air.  I would''ve taken this pic a millisecond sooner so the tee was more vertical...and you should have placed a softbox where the tee is to illuminate his face better.  From my experience, people don''t appreciate the timing of these shots.  Perhaps a title that let''s the non-golfer know that the ball is travelling about 160-170mph at this point would help them??  Curious to see how this shot fares.</td>', 'I don'' t really care for the angle at which you caught the tee floating in the air.  I would''ve taken this pic a millisecond sooner so the tee was more vertical...and you should have placed a softbox where the tee is to illuminate his face better.  From my experience, people don''t appreciate the timing of these shots.  Perhaps a title that let''s the non-golfer know that the ball is travelling about 160-170mph at this point would help them??  Curious to see how this shot fares.', '2005-07-13 10:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
