(1533946, 202731, 39243, '<td valign="top">great idea but not much is in focus sorry.</td>', 'great idea but not much is in focus sorry.', '2005-07-13 20:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1533948, 202388, 38187, '<td valign="top">This would have shown much better if the photo was bigger. If you change the pixels instead of the size of the pic, you can fit the required file size. My guess is that the scores will be lower than they should because of the size. I hope I am wrong. I like this shot. Good luck!</td>', 'This would have shown much better if the photo was bigger. If you change the pixels instead of the size of the pic, you can fit the required file size. My guess is that the scores will be lower than they should because of the size. I hope I am wrong. I like this shot. Good luck!', '2005-07-13 20:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
