(1533952, 202337, 37875, '<td valign="top">Cool moment to capture.  The image feels like it is just a bit overexposed, or the bright/contrast tweaked too bright, or maybe sharpness or something tweaked a bit too hard.  I wish I could explain this better.  I adjusted my monitor just in case, but the grainy glare on the ground and other light spots in the photo actually became a bit distracting for me.</td>', 'Cool moment to capture.  The image feels like it is just a bit overexposed, or the bright/contrast tweaked too bright, or maybe sharpness or something tweaked a bit too hard.  I wish I could explain this better.  I adjusted my monitor just in case, but the grainy glare on the ground and other light spots in the photo actually became a bit distracting for me.', '2005-07-13 20:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1533953, 203255, 39243, '<td valign="top">too bad this one isn''t bigger and it isnt closer.</td>', 'too bad this one isn''t bigger and it isnt closer.', '2005-07-13 20:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
