(1533971, 203062, 37875, '<td valign="top">Groovy photo, and wild colors!  The photo feels just a bit overexposed in #22''s upper body/head area, which detracts from the photo for me.  Otherwise, I love the energy in the kick about to happen and the ball overing over that golden field.</td>', 'Groovy photo, and wild colors!  The photo feels just a bit overexposed in #22''s upper body/head area, which detracts from the photo for me.  Otherwise, I love the energy in the kick about to happen and the ball overing over that golden field.', '2005-07-13 20:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
