(1533975, 201278, 34906, '<td valign="top">Something very magnetic about this shot.  All the action in the background is directed in one one, the foreground image in another.  I like it.</td>', 'Something very magnetic about this shot.  All the action in the background is directed in one one, the foreground image in another.  I like it.', '2005-07-13 20:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
