(1534933, 200897, 36981, '<td valign="top">I think that silhouettes really benefit from a plain background, so that the subject stands out.  In this image, I would have liked either a) no tree, or b) light on the subject so that I could distinguish better between them.  I also would have preferred that the archer fill more of the frame.</td>', 'I think that silhouettes really benefit from a plain background, so that the subject stands out.  In this image, I would have liked either a) no tree, or b) light on the subject so that I could distinguish better between them.  I also would have preferred that the archer fill more of the frame.', '2005-07-14 09:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1534934, 200897, 4477, '<td valign="top">A tad too dark.</td>', 'A tad too dark.', '2005-07-14 09:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
