(1535182, 202776, 39111, '<td valign="top">see if you can get a larger image up next time, it''s hard to appreciate these small images.  i think the composition is off with the flag being in kind of an unusual spot, perhaps cut out more of the grey seating and have people closer to the bottom of the image?  also, the focus seems soft.</td>', 'see if you can get a larger image up next time, it''s hard to appreciate these small images.  i think the composition is off with the flag being in kind of an unusual spot, perhaps cut out more of the grey seating and have people closer to the bottom of the image?  also, the focus seems soft.', '2005-07-14 11:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
