(1535645, 202433, 34192, '<td valign="top">Great image.  Wish the skin tones were just a little lighter so I could see his face better.  Well done - 8 good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Great image.  Wish the skin tones were just a little lighter so I could see his face better.  Well done - 8 good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-14 14:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
