(1535675, 201619, 34192, '<td valign="top">Excellent stop motion capture. Crop and POV excellent.  Lighting good considering. excellent color range.  Very well done.  9 - good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Excellent stop motion capture. Crop and POV excellent.  Lighting good considering. excellent color range.  Very well done.  9 - good luck in the challenge.', '2005-07-14 14:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
