(1535705, 202993, 35530, '<td valign="top">This is a remarkable shot. The only thing I can see wrong (at least on my monitor) is your straight lines are pixelated. Probably from rotating the shot post-process as opposed to tahing the shot at that angle. I get that all the time too. Still, high marks for a super capture.</td>', 'This is a remarkable shot. The only thing I can see wrong (at least on my monitor) is your straight lines are pixelated. Probably from rotating the shot post-process as opposed to tahing the shot at that angle. I get that all the time too. Still, high marks for a super capture.', '2005-07-14 15:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535709, 202209, 37130, '<td valign="top">Nice action, dof, color, lighting and comp. What more can we ask for, reality. -9-</td>', 'Nice action, dof, color, lighting and comp. What more can we ask for, reality. -9-', '2005-07-14 15:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535715, 202717, 37130, '<td valign="top">Nice action. The lighting contrast a bit distracting, perhaps a cropping without the tree line would have appealed to me more.</td>', 'Nice action. The lighting contrast a bit distracting, perhaps a cropping without the tree line would have appealed to me more.', '2005-07-14 15:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
