(1535816, 203114, 40703, '<td valign="top">These kinds of shots always entertain me. Everyone''s captured in such an odd position. The guy in the middle looks like he''s about to push the other guy''s head off his shoulders. Very nice in B&amp;W, too. Well done. I give you a 9.</td>', 'These kinds of shots always entertain me. Everyone''s captured in such an odd position. The guy in the middle looks like he''s about to push the other guy''s head off his shoulders. Very nice in B&W, too. Well done. I give you a 9.', '2005-07-14 15:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
