(1535822, 202564, 40703, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if anyone notices this, but this spells ''KKK'' and I think it''s unintentional. I think there''s more focus on the cards than the actual ''sport'' of them, but, it''s a good shot nonetheless. Just be careful with the three K''s. I give you a 5.</td>', 'I don''t know if anyone notices this, but this spells ''KKK'' and I think it''s unintentional. I think there''s more focus on the cards than the actual ''sport'' of them, but, it''s a good shot nonetheless. Just be careful with the three K''s. I give you a 5.', '2005-07-14 15:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
