(1535880, 200999, 30018, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, which includes nice stop-action photography and enough momentum to keep the eye moving.  Wonderful tonal range, and filled with textures.  The grace and beauty of baseketball seems to be getting the higher scores from me in this challenge, although my favorite sport is baseball, and those images are not so good for the most part.  I love this shot, and hope it does very well for you!  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, which includes nice stop-action photography and enough momentum to keep the eye moving.  Wonderful tonal range, and filled with textures.  The grace and beauty of baseketball seems to be getting the higher scores from me in this challenge, although my favorite sport is baseball, and those images are not so good for the most part.  I love this shot, and hope it does very well for you!  <9>', '2005-07-14 16:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
