(1536200, 203096, 36981, '<td valign="top">This definitely made me laugh.  I love the looks on the faces, and it makes me want to know what happened next.  Was there a card?  Congrats on a great image.</td>', 'This definitely made me laugh.  I love the looks on the faces, and it makes me want to know what happened next.  Was there a card?  Congrats on a great image.', '2005-07-14 19:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
