(1536816, 201934, 31403, '<td valign="top">lots of visual distraction that a crop would eliminate, the white line leads my eye up the right side of the photo first, then comes back to the biker.  I''ll bet it was cool being that close to him though</td>', 'lots of visual distraction that a crop would eliminate, the white line leads my eye up the right side of the photo first, then comes back to the biker.  I''ll bet it was cool being that close to him though', '2005-07-15 01:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
