(1537043, 201095, 23394, '<td valign="top">while this has all the makings of the type of image i enjoy (especially when produced in camera), there''s not enough here detail or size wise for me to really get into the image, let alone relate it to sports action.<br/> <br/>however this finishes, don''t let it dissuade you.  check out this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=156130#1084676" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">thread</a> and KEEP ON SHOOTING!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-20 07:13:18.</i></td>', 'while this has all the makings of the type of image i enjoy (especially when produced in camera), there''s not enough here detail or size wise for me to really get into the image, let alone relate it to sports action. however this finishes, don''t let it dissuade you.  check out this thread and KEEP ON SHOOTING!', '2005-07-15 06:57:26.000000', '2005-07-20 08:13:18.000000', 1),
(1537044, 202320, 23394, '<td valign="top">no telling what type of comments you are getting, but i can only imagine how it is scoring...<br/> <br/>if you are really interested in photography, as well as dpc, check out this [url=//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=156130#1084676]thread[/url and KEEP ON SHOOTING!  better luck next time!</td>', 'no telling what type of comments you are getting, but i can only imagine how it is scoring... if you are really interested in photography, as well as dpc, check out this [url=//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&FORUM_THREAD_ID=156130#1084676]thread[/url and KEEP ON SHOOTING!  better luck next time!', '2005-07-15 06:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537047, 202994, 23394, '<td valign="top">little over exposed on the bottle, but nice reflection on the board.  i think you missed the part of the definition about ''anything with beer is sport''...it''s actually anything with beer AND BLOOD--if you had put some blood on the board, i''m sure this would have scored a lot higher.  better luck next time!</td>', 'little over exposed on the bottle, but nice reflection on the board.  i think you missed the part of the definition about ''anything with beer is sport''...it''s actually anything with beer AND BLOOD--if you had put some blood on the board, i''m sure this would have scored a lot higher.  better luck next time!', '2005-07-15 07:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537051, 203004, 23394, '<td valign="top">no doubt you are getting hammered for your take on ''sport''.  as a photograph, this is ok.  it would probably be more interesting, though, with a short dof (making the background blurry and less distracting).  if you are going to shoot ''outside the box'' on challenges, please take into consideration all the things that can make an image to life.  you also might want to check out this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=156130#1084676" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">thread</a>.</td>', 'no doubt you are getting hammered for your take on ''sport''.  as a photograph, this is ok.  it would probably be more interesting, though, with a short dof (making the background blurry and less distracting).  if you are going to shoot ''outside the box'' on challenges, please take into consideration all the things that can make an image to life.  you also might want to check out this thread.', '2005-07-15 07:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537055, 203145, 37130, '<td valign="top">Nice action, color, comp and lighting. The dof a bit out and the person in the background distracting.</td>', 'Nice action, color, comp and lighting. The dof a bit out and the person in the background distracting.', '2005-07-15 07:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537056, 202972, 23394, '<td valign="top">this has the makings of a fine photograph, but could use a little work.  you''ve probably been told that the horizon is tilted and that it either looks oversharpened or too noisy or not sharp enough and/or that the border wasn''t applied evenly.  just don''t take any of it (especially your score) personally.  just keep on shooting and submitting, and you will get where you want to be!<br/> <br/>you might want to check out this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=156130#1084676" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">thread</a> for some more pointers on how to score higher.  good luck!</td>', 'this has the makings of a fine photograph, but could use a little work.  you''ve probably been told that the horizon is tilted and that it either looks oversharpened or too noisy or not sharp enough and/or that the border wasn''t applied evenly.  just don''t take any of it (especially your score) personally.  just keep on shooting and submitting, and you will get where you want to be! you might want to check out this thread for some more pointers on how to score higher.  good luck!', '2005-07-15 07:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
