(1537850, 201979, 7743, '<td valign="top">Great stop action although the lighting is a little flat.  A sense of motion I think would improve the presentation a bit.</td>', 'Great stop action although the lighting is a little flat.  A sense of motion I think would improve the presentation a bit.', '2005-07-15 15:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537854, 202685, 7743, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette.  The graininess adds to the mood of the image.  I feel that if the subject were a bit on the diagonal the image would be much more dynamic.</td>', 'Great silhouette.  The graininess adds to the mood of the image.  I feel that if the subject were a bit on the diagonal the image would be much more dynamic.', '2005-07-15 15:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537861, 202692, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp photo however the band of light at the top is a bit distracting.  Also, as composed this is a bit of a stretch for the challenge.  For this to work I believe a wide angle shot with a person wearing a leather gauntlet and hand in the air as if they had just released the bird.</td>', 'Nice sharp photo however the band of light at the top is a bit distracting.  Also, as composed this is a bit of a stretch for the challenge.  For this to work I believe a wide angle shot with a person wearing a leather gauntlet and hand in the air as if they had just released the bird.', '2005-07-15 15:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537885, 202720, 37409, '<td valign="top">Lacks focus but I can see why :) Cool concept.</td>', 'Lacks focus but I can see why :) Cool concept.', '2005-07-15 15:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537888, 202190, 37409, '<td valign="top">Ahhh.. my back !!! :)<br/>Cool shot. would have been nice if he had been in the scrum</td>', 'Ahhh.. my back !!! :)Cool shot. would have been nice if he had been in the scrum', '2005-07-15 15:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537889, 203041, 37409, '<td valign="top">Colors seem dull, but the DOF is really nice</td>', 'Colors seem dull, but the DOF is really nice', '2005-07-15 15:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537893, 202471, 37409, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF, nice composition. It would have been really cool if you would have been looking down from thrid base and got the batter in full swing as number 9 leads.</td>', 'Excellent DOF, nice composition. It would have been really cool if you would have been looking down from thrid base and got the batter in full swing as number 9 leads.', '2005-07-15 15:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537895, 203115, 37409, '<td valign="top">Too much blue tine, colors off. Maybe if the break would have been caught at the beginning, you could have had some triangular geometry, colors from the balls etc.</td>', 'Too much blue tine, colors off. Maybe if the break would have been caught at the beginning, you could have had some triangular geometry, colors from the balls etc.', '2005-07-15 15:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537897, 202780, 37409, '<td valign="top">The DOF should be more shallow to keep focus on the rider. How it is the crowd distracts.</td>', 'The DOF should be more shallow to keep focus on the rider. How it is the crowd distracts.', '2005-07-15 15:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537900, 201885, 37409, '<td valign="top">Did you use a tripod? It doesnt seem as sharp as it could be.</td>', 'Did you use a tripod? It doesnt seem as sharp as it could be.', '2005-07-15 15:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537903, 203062, 37409, '<td valign="top">Colors seem a little saturated.<br/>I would have cropped just left of the far Yellow player to get the buildings out. This would have left you with all attention on the game.</td>', 'Colors seem a little saturated.I would have cropped just left of the far Yellow player to get the buildings out. This would have left you with all attention on the game.', '2005-07-15 15:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537905, 203173, 37409, '<td valign="top">Great shot, would have been better with less noise. A nice sharp B&amp;W</td>', 'Great shot, would have been better with less noise. A nice sharp B&W', '2005-07-15 15:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537907, 202671, 37409, '<td valign="top">Great action shot. Would have been awesome if your background wasnt so busy. Could you have taken from another angle and gotten just the pitch and a shallow background?</td>', 'Great action shot. Would have been awesome if your background wasnt so busy. Could you have taken from another angle and gotten just the pitch and a shallow background?', '2005-07-15 15:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537908, 202079, 37409, '<td valign="top">Great action shot. My favorite thus far into my voting. Everything appeals to me on this one.</td>', 'Great action shot. My favorite thus far into my voting. Everything appeals to me on this one.', '2005-07-15 15:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537910, 202564, 37409, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, dont know if gambing is a sport, but it is a competition so Ill give it to ya ;)</td>', 'Nice composition, dont know if gambing is a sport, but it is a competition so Ill give it to ya ;)', '2005-07-15 15:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537913, 201466, 37409, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of those motivation posters. Good shot, might be just a tad overblown in the beginning of the light. Still nice shot.</td>', 'Reminds me of those motivation posters. Good shot, might be just a tad overblown in the beginning of the light. Still nice shot.', '2005-07-15 15:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537914, 202871, 37409, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, maybe a little faster on the shutter speed and you could have gotten a sharper image on the foreground dragster.</td>', 'Nice colors, maybe a little faster on the shutter speed and you could have gotten a sharper image on the foreground dragster.', '2005-07-15 15:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537917, 203092, 37409, '<td valign="top">Nice how you did a long exposure to get his arm movements.</td>', 'Nice how you did a long exposure to get his arm movements.', '2005-07-15 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 1);
