(1538496, 201958, 34547, '<td valign="top">He must have caught that kickflip fairly early. I like what the flash does for this photo, except the shadow. The wide-angle lens makes this fit right in with what you see in the mags. Good job.</td>', 'He must have caught that kickflip fairly early. I like what the flash does for this photo, except the shadow. The wide-angle lens makes this fit right in with what you see in the mags. Good job.', '2005-07-15 23:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538497, 202359, 259, '<td valign="top">nice stop acton.  there is a lot of dead space around the two players that could be cropped out.  Most sports shots are cropped as tight as possible to make the person feel closer to the action.  however, it''s still a fine shot.</td>', 'nice stop acton.  there is a lot of dead space around the two players that could be cropped out.  Most sports shots are cropped as tight as possible to make the person feel closer to the action.  however, it''s still a fine shot.', '2005-07-15 23:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538498, 203193, 259, '<td valign="top">nice blues</td>', 'nice blues', '2005-07-15 23:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
