(1538503, 203250, 34547, '<td valign="top">Almost a great photo. The motion on the ball is either too much or not enough. Where it is right now, it is too distracting for how the rest looks...still one of the better photos of the challenge.</td>', 'Almost a great photo. The motion on the ball is either too much or not enough. Where it is right now, it is too distracting for how the rest looks...still one of the better photos of the challenge.', '2005-07-15 23:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
