(1538549, 202388, 29513, '<td valign="top">This appears really small on my monitor.  Small enough that I can''t really tell much about how sharp things are.  Seems to be good framing and the colors are vivid but natural.</td>', 'This appears really small on my monitor.  Small enough that I can''t really tell much about how sharp things are.  Seems to be good framing and the colors are vivid but natural.', '2005-07-15 23:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
