(1538553, 202130, 259, '<td valign="top">very cool composition.  the border hurts more than it helps.  it should help frame the shot, and for me it draws my eye away from the subject.  the picture itself is very good though.</td>', 'very cool composition.  the border hurts more than it helps.  it should help frame the shot, and for me it draws my eye away from the subject.  the picture itself is very good though.', '2005-07-15 23:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
