(1538556, 202992, 29513, '<td valign="top">This looks really small on my monitor.  I think that this would be striking if the skier and the rooster tail are sharp, but I can''t tell.  I like the framing and the colors.</td>', 'This looks really small on my monitor.  I think that this would be striking if the skier and the rooster tail are sharp, but I can''t tell.  I like the framing and the colors.', '2005-07-15 23:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
