(1538631, 203196, 29513, '<td valign="top">This is almost really good.  I think that the subject is just a bit over exposed and there is something about the framing that I can''t put my finger on.  I like the colors and the way the background has receeded.</td>', 'This is almost really good.  I think that the subject is just a bit over exposed and there is something about the framing that I can''t put my finger on.  I like the colors and the way the background has receeded.', '2005-07-15 23:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538632, 202789, 6521, '<td valign="top">Fín mynd, mjög fínt. Það vantar bara boltann inn á hana og svo vantar að kroppa lengra inn í myndina, lengra inn í action-ið. Þá væri þetta helvíti fínt bara.</td>', 'Fín mynd, mjög fínt. Það vantar bara boltann inn á hana og svo vantar að kroppa lengra inn í myndina, lengra inn í action-ið. Þá væri þetta helvíti fínt bara.', '2005-07-15 23:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
