(1538764, 202471, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  I like the choice of bw here.  It reduces distraction and puts the focus on the foreground subject.  Very well done.  You will probably receive comments about the frame.  I like it, but it may be a bit too wide - a little overdone. 9.</td>', 'Great composition.  I like the choice of bw here.  It reduces distraction and puts the focus on the foreground subject.  Very well done.  You will probably receive comments about the frame.  I like it, but it may be a bit too wide - a little overdone. 9.', '2005-07-16 02:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538766, 203040, 25464, '<td valign="top">Well, thats action.  simple composition with little distraction.  Nice color.  The light is a bit harsh but appropriate for the subject.  Good.</td>', 'Well, thats action.  simple composition with little distraction.  Nice color.  The light is a bit harsh but appropriate for the subject.  Good.', '2005-07-16 02:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538769, 202308, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  Looks a little overprocessed to me, almost painting like, but I like it.</td>', 'Great composition.  Looks a little overprocessed to me, almost painting like, but I like it.', '2005-07-16 02:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538772, 201363, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, but the composition is a little boring.  I think the subject (batter) is a bit too centered in the frame and the lines of the field seem to cut the shot in half.  I think it would be better if the batter were in the lower right quadrant of the frame with more visible crowd.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, but the composition is a little boring.  I think the subject (batter) is a bit too centered in the frame and the lines of the field seem to cut the shot in half.  I think it would be better if the batter were in the lower right quadrant of the frame with more visible crowd.', '2005-07-16 02:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538774, 201463, 25464, '<td valign="top">nicely composed beautiful shot.  No big wow, but very nice.</td>', 'nicely composed beautiful shot.  No big wow, but very nice.', '2005-07-16 02:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538776, 202536, 25464, '<td valign="top">Tight fit into the catagory I think, but what an excellent shot.  I think I would have wanted to fit it in as well.  Dont be discouraged if this scores poorly.  I recently ran across a contest for big cat photos.  You should google it and enter this one.  Good luck. 8</td>', 'Tight fit into the catagory I think, but what an excellent shot.  I think I would have wanted to fit it in as well.  Dont be discouraged if this scores poorly.  I recently ran across a contest for big cat photos.  You should google it and enter this one.  Good luck. 8', '2005-07-16 02:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
