(1538947, 202692, 22748, '<td valign="top">Incredibly sharp image. Nice non-distracting background. Did you use off-camera flash? It''s very nice.</td>', 'Incredibly sharp image. Nice non-distracting background. Did you use off-camera flash? It''s very nice.', '2005-07-16 06:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
