(1538962, 202801, 37130, '<td valign="top">Action very little. Color, dof and comp gr8. The grainy effect on the trousers a bit distracting.</td>', 'Action very little. Color, dof and comp gr8. The grainy effect on the trousers a bit distracting.', '2005-07-16 08:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
