(1539001, 203260, 4281, '<td valign="top">Had the face been shown in this photo it would have been very good. But as it is, it''s only a so so image.</td>', 'Had the face been shown in this photo it would have been very good. But as it is, it''s only a so so image.', '2005-07-16 08:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
