(1539007, 202128, 10047, '<td valign="top">I  might have tried moving to the left a little more to get rid of th grey structure and use the bushes only, as a background. Maybe a tad more shutter speed would have frozen the face and kept the ball moving. Good form.</td>', 'I  might have tried moving to the left a little more to get rid of th grey structure and use the bushes only, as a background. Maybe a tad more shutter speed would have frozen the face and kept the ball moving. Good form.', '2005-07-16 08:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
