(1539333, 201958, 36043, '<td valign="top">Timing is great, choice of lens is superb. Composition could be stronger with closer positioning perhaps.  It''s tough to get sufficiently reduced depth of field with a fisheye/wide angle.  I really like the choice of flash positioning - great shadow.</td>', 'Timing is great, choice of lens is superb. Composition could be stronger with closer positioning perhaps.  It''s tough to get sufficiently reduced depth of field with a fisheye/wide angle.  I really like the choice of flash positioning - great shadow.', '2005-07-16 14:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
