(1541075, 202939, 23394, '<td valign="top">ok, this is a cool shot, very well executed.  all the same, there is nothing in the image that really conveys the idea of sport to me, in the sense of competition, team play, or the like.  believe me, i know bike racing is a sport, but i don''t get the sense of a race from this image.  killer shot, though, and hope it does well for you.</td>', 'ok, this is a cool shot, very well executed.  all the same, there is nothing in the image that really conveys the idea of sport to me, in the sense of competition, team play, or the like.  believe me, i know bike racing is a sport, but i don''t get the sense of a race from this image.  killer shot, though, and hope it does well for you.', '2005-07-17 14:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
