(1542754, 203002, 39430, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.  I like the idea, and it''s well executed.  Blade of grass on RHS is distracting, and it would have been nice if the sky was blue, but a nice shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Very interesting shot.  I like the idea, and it''s well executed.  Blade of grass on RHS is distracting, and it would have been nice if the sky was blue, but a nice shot nonetheless.', '2005-07-18 02:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
