(1542784, 203269, 39430, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped out the snappers on the LHS.  Nice BW though.  It''s hard to BW a shot with a cluttered background, but the long shot helps by misting the distance.</td>', 'I would have cropped out the snappers on the LHS.  Nice BW though.  It''s hard to BW a shot with a cluttered background, but the long shot helps by misting the distance.', '2005-07-18 02:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
