(1542831, 202692, 39430, '<td valign="top">Bit of a squeeze to get a nice bird shot into the sports theme.  If the shot is about falconry, where''s the falconer?  Low score for that.  Sorry.  Nice shot though, apart from the flash highlights.</td>', 'Bit of a squeeze to get a nice bird shot into the sports theme.  If the shot is about falconry, where''s the falconer?  Low score for that.  Sorry.  Nice shot though, apart from the flash highlights.', '2005-07-18 03:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
