(1542863, 203146, 39430, '<td valign="top">Wow, challenging shot.  Great timing for the background.  Could do with some USM and levels, but a great shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Wow, challenging shot.  Great timing for the background.  Could do with some USM and levels, but a great shot nonetheless.', '2005-07-18 03:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
