(1543149, 200897, 39430, '<td valign="top">Subject is very hidden by the tree.  I like the idea of deliberately camouflaging the subject, but somehow it doesn''t come off for a good photo.</td>', 'Subject is very hidden by the tree.  I like the idea of deliberately camouflaging the subject, but somehow it doesn''t come off for a good photo.', '2005-07-18 08:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
