(1543154, 202209, 39430, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Awesome action shot.  Great clarity for the long zoom, and a nice range of colours in the water.</td>', 'Wow!  Awesome action shot.  Great clarity for the long zoom, and a nice range of colours in the water.', '2005-07-18 08:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543156, 201925, 39430, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title.  With the photo cropped so tight, I can''t see any point of interest left in the photo.</td>', 'I don''t understand the title.  With the photo cropped so tight, I can''t see any point of interest left in the photo.', '2005-07-18 08:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543163, 202079, 39430, '<td valign="top">Some CA probably from a cheap lens at the long end of the zoom.  Also worked too much for my liking - oversaturated colours.  Nice action shot though, and well cropped.</td>', 'Some CA probably from a cheap lens at the long end of the zoom.  Also worked too much for my liking - oversaturated colours.  Nice action shot though, and well cropped.', '2005-07-18 08:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543168, 202189, 39430, '<td valign="top">White background makes for a nice uncluttered shot, but it''s a bit stark.  Good cropping.</td>', 'White background makes for a nice uncluttered shot, but it''s a bit stark.  Good cropping.', '2005-07-18 08:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543271, 203165, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - I like this shot 90% for the young fellow far right.  For me he makes this shot; his facial expression, the movement and ''action'' of his mouth, his untied shoelace(s) and his sheer grit and determination.  Without him and his character, for me this shot would be a 5 for this challenge and a 3 as a ''general'' photograph.  Criticism, for me maybe a closer crop at the foreground, not sure.  Something to bring ''him'' to the centre if possible, no clue how, but for me, he is the star attraction regardless.</td>', '9 - I like this shot 90% for the young fellow far right.  For me he makes this shot; his facial expression, the movement and ''action'' of his mouth, his untied shoelace(s) and his sheer grit and determination.  Without him and his character, for me this shot would be a 5 for this challenge and a 3 as a ''general'' photograph.  Criticism, for me maybe a closer crop at the foreground, not sure.  Something to bring ''him'' to the centre if possible, no clue how, but for me, he is the star attraction regardless.', '2005-07-18 09:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543289, 202471, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Nice shot.  I like that there seems to be maybe three ''sets'' of people within this shot that are all focused on something different, and you have captured that.  I like the sepia?, adds to the character.  Criticism; difficult as anything you do, cropping, coloring, would likely detract from the ''set'' aspect I just explained.  Good ''little people'' action shot.  I think the frame works too.</td>', '9 - Nice shot.  I like that there seems to be maybe three ''sets'' of people within this shot that are all focused on something different, and you have captured that.  I like the sepia?, adds to the character.  Criticism; difficult as anything you do, cropping, coloring, would likely detract from the ''set'' aspect I just explained.  Good ''little people'' action shot.  I think the frame works too.', '2005-07-18 09:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543300, 202190, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - This is likely my favorite of the challenge.  Good capture and character.  For me the character of this photograph has the most appeal.  Criticism; although the colors seem slightly ''dull'', I think that adds to this photograph and any variation would detract.  Perhaps something done in pp with the ''overexposure'' of #9''s hair, but then that does draw the eye there.  Maybe a different angle, maybe somehow making #9 ''stand out'' more, not sure.  The seemingly candid nature of this photograph and making the viewer (me) feel like I am getting a glimpse at a run of the mill weekend ''scrummage'' match, make this stand out, for me. '' Feels'' real.</td>', '9 - This is likely my favorite of the challenge.  Good capture and character.  For me the character of this photograph has the most appeal.  Criticism; although the colors seem slightly ''dull'', I think that adds to this photograph and any variation would detract.  Perhaps something done in pp with the ''overexposure'' of #9''s hair, but then that does draw the eye there.  Maybe a different angle, maybe somehow making #9 ''stand out'' more, not sure.  The seemingly candid nature of this photograph and making the viewer (me) feel like I am getting a glimpse at a run of the mill weekend ''scrummage'' match, make this stand out, for me. '' Feels'' real.', '2005-07-18 09:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543309, 203067, 39430, '<td valign="top">A bit over contrasty, and oversharpened, but not a bad shot.</td>', 'A bit over contrasty, and oversharpened, but not a bad shot.', '2005-07-18 09:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543310, 202994, 39430, '<td valign="top">Sports?  Nice shot, but I can''t see any relationship between the beer, the chess or the sports theme.</td>', 'Sports?  Nice shot, but I can''t see any relationship between the beer, the chess or the sports theme.', '2005-07-18 09:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543316, 203146, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Great angle, nice and clean, good simple colors.  Criticism; more focus, perhaps a different crop, not sure though as you have a good perspective.  Just sharper on the glider or the ''glider''.  The frame - not sure, given the color of the sand below, I think you may have lost a lot of the ''expanse'' feel with the frame.</td>', '8 - Great angle, nice and clean, good simple colors.  Criticism; more focus, perhaps a different crop, not sure though as you have a good perspective.  Just sharper on the glider or the ''glider''.  The frame - not sure, given the color of the sand below, I think you may have lost a lot of the ''expanse'' feel with the frame.', '2005-07-18 09:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543326, 203121, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good action shot and capture.  Gives a good sense of speed and ''cut''.  Criticism; maybe a different crop, not sure.  Title would be better indicating the vehicle or speed or ''cornering''/''cut'', rather than the focus on the cone which is a minor aspect, in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Good action shot and capture.  Gives a good sense of speed and ''cut''.  Criticism; maybe a different crop, not sure.  Title would be better indicating the vehicle or speed or ''cornering''/''cut'', rather than the focus on the cone which is a minor aspect, in my opinion.', '2005-07-18 09:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543335, 202721, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Not a bad surf shot, without the title I wouldn''t have ''grasped'' the secondary ''action'' here.  Adds another element altogether.  Good opportunity.  Criticism; more focus of course, maybe tighter crop, somehow enhancing the contrasting blue/green of the ocean, but with the color of the surfer that would be hard.  This shot is about the ''double action'' though, as I perceive it, so you have probably done the best you could with what you have.</td>', '8 - Not a bad surf shot, without the title I wouldn''t have ''grasped'' the secondary ''action'' here.  Adds another element altogether.  Good opportunity.  Criticism; more focus of course, maybe tighter crop, somehow enhancing the contrasting blue/green of the ocean, but with the color of the surfer that would be hard.  This shot is about the ''double action'' though, as I perceive it, so you have probably done the best you could with what you have.', '2005-07-18 09:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543340, 202420, 36487, '<td valign="top">Love the fielders concentration - well taken.</td>', 'Love the fielders concentration - well taken.', '2005-07-18 10:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543342, 202847, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good shot.  Like the sepia?  Like the almost ''barren-ness'', or at least how you have made it ''feel'' that way.  Criticism; more ''bare'', ''barren'' feel would be good, different angle, to exclude the buildings in the background.  The frame, while it does enhance the dark colors, it does also detract from the ''said barren-ness''.</td>', '8 - Good shot.  Like the sepia?  Like the almost ''barren-ness'', or at least how you have made it ''feel'' that way.  Criticism; more ''bare'', ''barren'' feel would be good, different angle, to exclude the buildings in the background.  The frame, while it does enhance the dark colors, it does also detract from the ''said barren-ness''.', '2005-07-18 10:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543343, 203253, 39430, '<td valign="top">My favourite bit is the kids in the background who aren''t watching, because their mom''s telling them something.  :)</td>', 'My favourite bit is the kids in the background who aren''t watching, because their mom''s telling them something.  :)', '2005-07-18 10:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543344, 202634, 36487, '<td valign="top">Ttitle should be Kayaking, not rafting.</td>', 'Ttitle should be Kayaking, not rafting.', '2005-07-18 10:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543346, 202727, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good shot, good character, shows the effort and endurance.  Good mix of bold colors.  Criticism; slight rotation perhaps and a different crop.  More focus.  Maybe slighter tighter angle to get more detail in the face.</td>', '8 - Good shot, good character, shows the effort and endurance.  Good mix of bold colors.  Criticism; slight rotation perhaps and a different crop.  More focus.  Maybe slighter tighter angle to get more detail in the face.', '2005-07-18 10:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543350, 202619, 39430, '<td valign="top">Normally I''d vote really low for a shot with this much motion blur, but there''s something about it, and little pieces everywhere that aren''t blurred.  It''s actually really effective.</td>', 'Normally I''d vote really low for a shot with this much motion blur, but there''s something about it, and little pieces everywhere that aren''t blurred.  It''s actually really effective.', '2005-07-18 10:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543356, 201166, 36487, '<td valign="top">background distracts, and looks over exposed, otherwise, great timing.</td>', 'background distracts, and looks over exposed, otherwise, great timing.', '2005-07-18 10:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543358, 202365, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good clean shot against a clear sky.  Criticism; perhaps a little darker coloring.  More sharpness.  Maybe black and white, not sure.  Something to ''bring out'' the ''chrome'' would be good and maybe some ''spinning'' of the wheels, if possible, just for an edge.</td>', '8 - Good clean shot against a clear sky.  Criticism; perhaps a little darker coloring.  More sharpness.  Maybe black and white, not sure.  Something to ''bring out'' the ''chrome'' would be good and maybe some ''spinning'' of the wheels, if possible, just for an edge.', '2005-07-18 10:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543361, 201442, 39430, '<td valign="top">Aw, you chopped off his head.  :P (is there a tongue in cheek smilie?)  Effective shot.  Good one for the breaking the rules category.</td>', 'Aw, you chopped off his head.  :P (is there a tongue in cheek smilie?)  Effective shot.  Good one for the breaking the rules category.', '2005-07-18 10:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543363, 202739, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good action shot, good title.  Criticism;  tighter crop, sharper, more focus.</td>', '8 - Good action shot, good title.  Criticism;  tighter crop, sharper, more focus.', '2005-07-18 10:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543373, 201981, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - I really like this shot but can''t quite take it up to 9.  Really like the intensity in her face and the concentration and focus.  Good angle and capture of the stance/positioning.  Criticism;  somehow closer, enhancing that said ''intensity''.  Sharper and bolder and ''richer'' for me would make this better.  Maybe, more ''blur'' on the one in the background, not sure, as that does ''add'' to this photograph as is.  The ''frames'' in the background add too.  Maybe with the ''funeral home sponsor'' brought into it more, woiuld make ''Emily'' seem all the ''meaner'' - (for a girl).</td>', '8 - I really like this shot but can''t quite take it up to 9.  Really like the intensity in her face and the concentration and focus.  Good angle and capture of the stance/positioning.  Criticism;  somehow closer, enhancing that said ''intensity''.  Sharper and bolder and ''richer'' for me would make this better.  Maybe, more ''blur'' on the one in the background, not sure, as that does ''add'' to this photograph as is.  The ''frames'' in the background add too.  Maybe with the ''funeral home sponsor'' brought into it more, woiuld make ''Emily'' seem all the ''meaner'' - (for a girl).', '2005-07-18 10:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543377, 202988, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Just a good simple action ''family'' shot.  Good ''feel''.  Criticism;  sharper, ''closer'', maybe a different angle, but I do like the ''head on'' of this.  Maybe a closer crop, forsaking the spray and nose to bring out the real ''feel'' of the ''ride with pop''.  Nice background.</td>', '8 - Just a good simple action ''family'' shot.  Good ''feel''.  Criticism;  sharper, ''closer'', maybe a different angle, but I do like the ''head on'' of this.  Maybe a closer crop, forsaking the spray and nose to bring out the real ''feel'' of the ''ride with pop''.  Nice background.', '2005-07-18 10:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543378, 202209, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good surf shot, good capture of the wave ''cut'' and ''spray''.  Criticism;  more detail, maybe stronger colors, different crop.  Given the water ''spray'', maybe black and white for this would work, not sure.</td>', '8 - Good surf shot, good capture of the wave ''cut'' and ''spray''.  Criticism;  more detail, maybe stronger colors, different crop.  Given the water ''spray'', maybe black and white for this would work, not sure.', '2005-07-18 10:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543382, 202457, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good ''moment'' capture.  Criticism; richer colors, focus further in the fore (to me it looks like the first patch of grass is in focus).  Maybe a tighter crop.  Dust is good.  Just the focus and sharpness, lighting is likely difficult with the black background.  Also to gain more ''feel'' on the ''red'' players'' faces would be better, for me.</td>', '8 - Good ''moment'' capture.  Criticism; richer colors, focus further in the fore (to me it looks like the first patch of grass is in focus).  Maybe a tighter crop.  Dust is good.  Just the focus and sharpness, lighting is likely difficult with the black background.  Also to gain more ''feel'' on the ''red'' players'' faces would be better, for me.', '2005-07-18 10:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543384, 202913, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice clean shot.  Excellent ''wave'' and spray capture.  Criticism; skier is a little dark, and if they were looking up or ''toward'' would be better.  Background is very good.  Maybe a slight rotation to the left, not sure, to get that background water/shrub line level, would also give more ''angle'' and intensity to the skier.  I like the black and white, but given the simplicity of the water/spray/shrubs, perhaps the color would have played well.</td>', '8 - Nice clean shot.  Excellent ''wave'' and spray capture.  Criticism; skier is a little dark, and if they were looking up or ''toward'' would be better.  Background is very good.  Maybe a slight rotation to the left, not sure, to get that background water/shrub line level, would also give more ''angle'' and intensity to the skier.  I like the black and white, but given the simplicity of the water/spray/shrubs, perhaps the color would have played well.', '2005-07-18 10:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543388, 200999, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good, fairly clean, simple action shot.  Criticism; for me this would be a better picture with just the two ''players''.  The one in the background takes a lot away from this shot.  Good capture of the ''feel'' though.  Sharper, different crop, better focus.</td>', '8 - Good, fairly clean, simple action shot.  Criticism; for me this would be a better picture with just the two ''players''.  The one in the background takes a lot away from this shot.  Good capture of the ''feel'' though.  Sharper, different crop, better focus.', '2005-07-18 10:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543399, 202337, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Excellent opportunity capture.  Criticism; sharper, bolder (colors and texture) and ''if only'' to capture that bat in absolute focus, would make this a better photograph for me.  A different crop, ''if only'' to get the catcher out of frame, but pretty impossible from this angle.  Superb action shot and I think, aside from a tighter crop, you have likely done the best you can with the opportunity you were given.  Possibly, black and white, but I am sure the bat would be lost even further.  Good title. Good shot.  Memorable.</td>', '8 - Excellent opportunity capture.  Criticism; sharper, bolder (colors and texture) and ''if only'' to capture that bat in absolute focus, would make this a better photograph for me.  A different crop, ''if only'' to get the catcher out of frame, but pretty impossible from this angle.  Superb action shot and I think, aside from a tighter crop, you have likely done the best you can with the opportunity you were given.  Possibly, black and white, but I am sure the bat would be lost even further.  Good title. Good shot.  Memorable.', '2005-07-18 10:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543405, 202079, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good capture.  Good colors.  Good ''dirt''.  Criticism; sharper angle, tighter crop (to utilize the blue fencing only), slightly richer colors, would make this a better photograph for me.</td>', '8 - Good capture.  Good colors.  Good ''dirt''.  Criticism; sharper angle, tighter crop (to utilize the blue fencing only), slightly richer colors, would make this a better photograph for me.', '2005-07-18 10:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543412, 201619, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good shot.  Criticism; sharper, bolder color.  If you could enhance that water ''dripping off'' would be really good.  Maybe a tighter crop.</td>', '8 - Good shot.  Criticism; sharper, bolder color.  If you could enhance that water ''dripping off'' would be really good.  Maybe a tighter crop.', '2005-07-18 10:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543418, 201958, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good shot.  Good angle (fish eye? helps) and I really like the shadow on the wall.  Criticism; I think this shot would be great in black and white given the ''lines'' and the shadows and the fairly ''plain'' clothing.  Sharper and a tighter crop (to get rid of that roundish shadow and the top light, if possible) would make this a better photograph for me.</td>', '8 - Good shot.  Good angle (fish eye? helps) and I really like the shadow on the wall.  Criticism; I think this shot would be great in black and white given the ''lines'' and the shadows and the fairly ''plain'' clothing.  Sharper and a tighter crop (to get rid of that roundish shadow and the top light, if possible) would make this a better photograph for me.', '2005-07-18 10:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543427, 203250, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good clean simple shot.  Criticism; ''if only'' that ball were ''motionless'', or just sharper, more focus, not sure how or ''what''.  Seems the ring and net is in focus, and for me, either enhance the ring or else get the ball in focus.  Great angle, nice and clean.  Good simple colors.</td>', '8 - Good clean simple shot.  Criticism; ''if only'' that ball were ''motionless'', or just sharper, more focus, not sure how or ''what''.  Seems the ring and net is in focus, and for me, either enhance the ring or else get the ball in focus.  Great angle, nice and clean.  Good simple colors.', '2005-07-18 10:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543432, 202315, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good shot.  Criticism; whilst the background is very nice as is, for me, even simplified with a tighter crop removing the house and car would make this a better shot.  Maybe a little lighter on the parasailor, or at least the harness, but primarily the parasail and the strings emphasized would make it better.  Perhaps slightly richer color in that, but then that is likely difficult with such a rich background.  Perhaps if the focal point was changed the background may have been more blurred, which may have worked better, not sure.</td>', '8 - Good shot.  Criticism; whilst the background is very nice as is, for me, even simplified with a tighter crop removing the house and car would make this a better shot.  Maybe a little lighter on the parasailor, or at least the harness, but primarily the parasail and the strings emphasized would make it better.  Perhaps slightly richer color in that, but then that is likely difficult with such a rich background.  Perhaps if the focal point was changed the background may have been more blurred, which may have worked better, not sure.', '2005-07-18 10:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543442, 201278, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Great action shot.  Good intensity capture.  Another ''home feel/run of the mill scrimmage'' shot.  Criticism;  maybe richer colors, more/sharper focus on the ball, slightly different angle, maybe making it look like he is ''coming out'' of that ''scrum''.</td>', '8 - Great action shot.  Good intensity capture.  Another ''home feel/run of the mill scrimmage'' shot.  Criticism;  maybe richer colors, more/sharper focus on the ball, slightly different angle, maybe making it look like he is ''coming out'' of that ''scrum''.', '2005-07-18 10:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543447, 203269, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good action shot.  Good crowd feel too.  Criticism; sharper focus, more ''bold, on the rider, maybe tighter crop (top right), perhaps showing more depth/perspective of where he is going to land.</td>', '8 - Good action shot.  Good crowd feel too.  Criticism; sharper focus, more ''bold, on the rider, maybe tighter crop (top right), perhaps showing more depth/perspective of where he is going to land.', '2005-07-18 10:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543451, 202634, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Great action shot.  Criticism; maybe a slightly sharper angle, not sure.  Water enhanced more somehow.  Sharper focus on the kayaker.  A little more ''depth'' and color would make this a better shot for me.</td>', '8 - Great action shot.  Criticism; maybe a slightly sharper angle, not sure.  Water enhanced more somehow.  Sharper focus on the kayaker.  A little more ''depth'' and color would make this a better shot for me.', '2005-07-18 10:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543464, 202720, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good action shot and good perspective.  Criticism; difficult when it is self-posed but, maybe less of a crop, sharper, more color, no tongue sticking out, for me would make this a better shot.  Capturing/enhahcing the ''wave slash'' would be good too.</td>', '8 - Good action shot and good perspective.  Criticism; difficult when it is self-posed but, maybe less of a crop, sharper, more color, no tongue sticking out, for me would make this a better shot.  Capturing/enhahcing the ''wave slash'' would be good too.', '2005-07-18 11:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543472, 202308, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good shot.  Criticism;  although the flags, etc give good perspective, for me I think this would be a better shot with just the sky and clouds behind.  Enhancing those, bolder, brighter colors and more focus.  Either a dirtier, muddier bike and rider (better), or a cleaner one, one or the other would make this a better photograph in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Good shot.  Criticism;  although the flags, etc give good perspective, for me I think this would be a better shot with just the sky and clouds behind.  Enhancing those, bolder, brighter colors and more focus.  Either a dirtier, muddier bike and rider (better), or a cleaner one, one or the other would make this a better photograph in my opinion.', '2005-07-18 11:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543483, 203031, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - I really like this shot.  Great action shot, especially of the horse.  I just noticed the shadow of the hooves too, which looks great.  Great angle, great ''feel''.  I like the hat.  Criticism; the perspective is good but for me, not sure, maybe a different crop, different angle, perhaps a nudge rotation to the left, not sure.  Maybe black and white would work really well for this shot, don''t know.  Of course, more focus and sharpness, making the horse and rider (and hat) really stand out against the dirt/dust, would make this a much better photograph in my opinion.  Good capture.</td>', '8 - I really like this shot.  Great action shot, especially of the horse.  I just noticed the shadow of the hooves too, which looks great.  Great angle, great ''feel''.  I like the hat.  Criticism; the perspective is good but for me, not sure, maybe a different crop, different angle, perhaps a nudge rotation to the left, not sure.  Maybe black and white would work really well for this shot, don''t know.  Of course, more focus and sharpness, making the horse and rider (and hat) really stand out against the dirt/dust, would make this a much better photograph in my opinion.  Good capture.', '2005-07-18 11:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543493, 202644, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good action shot.  Good colors.  Criticism; sharper and more focus on either his face or the shuttlecock or forearm, would make this a better shot for me.  A little closer too.</td>', '8 - Good action shot.  Good colors.  Criticism; sharper and more focus on either his face or the shuttlecock or forearm, would make this a better shot for me.  A little closer too.', '2005-07-18 11:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543495, 202186, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Great action shot.  Criticism; different angle, showing the ball more, not sure.  Maybe ''full length'', not sure, more/different perspective, could make this a better shot, in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Great action shot.  Criticism; different angle, showing the ball more, not sure.  Maybe ''full length'', not sure, more/different perspective, could make this a better shot, in my opinion.', '2005-07-18 11:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543496, 202341, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good shot, good attitude of the rider, good pose.  Criticism; enhancing the chrome that is already semi shining.  Sharper, bolder, closer.</td>', '8 - Good shot, good attitude of the rider, good pose.  Criticism; enhancing the chrome that is already semi shining.  Sharper, bolder, closer.', '2005-07-18 11:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
