(1543899, 201957, 35135, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  The small amount of blur gives the impression of motion from the players and the ball.  You get the feeling that the runner is barely to the plate before the ball.  The angle of the shot makes it look like the 1st baseman is going to miss that ball anyway.</td>', 'Great shot.  The small amount of blur gives the impression of motion from the players and the ball.  You get the feeling that the runner is barely to the plate before the ball.  The angle of the shot makes it look like the 1st baseman is going to miss that ball anyway.', '2005-07-18 13:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543901, 203064, 35135, '<td valign="top">Too bad the little girl''s face is in shadow.  Kid''s and sports go together to make for great composition.</td>', 'Too bad the little girl''s face is in shadow.  Kid''s and sports go together to make for great composition.', '2005-07-18 13:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543906, 202294, 35135, '<td valign="top">Very crisp.  The blur on the hands show that the boy is moving quickly.  The expression is great.  I tried to get a clear shot like this along with the background on my shot but it didn''t turn out as well.</td>', 'Very crisp.  The blur on the hands show that the boy is moving quickly.  The expression is great.  I tried to get a clear shot like this along with the background on my shot but it didn''t turn out as well.', '2005-07-18 13:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543921, 203081, 35135, '<td valign="top">This image would look cool if it had more red tones like it was at sunset.  Or maybe a sepia tone...</td>', 'This image would look cool if it had more red tones like it was at sunset.  Or maybe a sepia tone...', '2005-07-18 13:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543927, 201826, 35135, '<td valign="top">Too blurry.  Either the road OR the bike should be blurry to give a sense of speed, but not both.  That just hurts the eyes.</td>', 'Too blurry.  Either the road OR the bike should be blurry to give a sense of speed, but not both.  That just hurts the eyes.', '2005-07-18 13:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543933, 202665, 35135, '<td valign="top">Crop out the right half of this picture.  The right side is too busy with the graffitti and it distracts from the rider.  Otherwise a good shot.</td>', 'Crop out the right half of this picture.  The right side is too busy with the graffitti and it distracts from the rider.  Otherwise a good shot.', '2005-07-18 13:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543939, 202593, 35135, '<td valign="top">Crop out the left side of this picture and some of the bottom.  We don''t need to see the ground.  The tops of the trees are enough to show us that this kid is WAY up there.  Otherwise great shot.</td>', 'Crop out the left side of this picture and some of the bottom.  We don''t need to see the ground.  The tops of the trees are enough to show us that this kid is WAY up there.  Otherwise great shot.', '2005-07-18 13:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
