(1543967, 203178, 38921, '<td valign="top">The border doesn''t do it for me but I didn''t downgrade for it either.  The background is too busy, a shallower depth of field would have helped this photo a lot. 6</td>', 'The border doesn''t do it for me but I didn''t downgrade for it either.  The background is too busy, a shallower depth of field would have helped this photo a lot. 6', '2005-07-18 14:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
