(1544463, 203201, 31593, '<td valign="top">Out of context.</td>', 'Out of context.', '2005-07-18 18:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544485, 202685, 30817, '<td valign="top">Except fpr a couple of sensor dust spots, this is a near flawless piece of art, not easy for a sports category.  This is my top pick for the week.</td>', 'Except fpr a couple of sensor dust spots, this is a near flawless piece of art, not easy for a sports category.  This is my top pick for the week.', '2005-07-18 18:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544487, 203276, 30817, '<td valign="top">Very nicely accomplished.  I really like the hand position shadow. One of my top 10 picks for this challenge.</td>', 'Very nicely accomplished.  I really like the hand position shadow. One of my top 10 picks for this challenge.', '2005-07-18 18:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544490, 202844, 30817, '<td valign="top">One of those serendipity captures that happens when a photographer is doing the right things.  Congratulations!  One of my top 10 favorites of this challenge.</td>', 'One of those serendipity captures that happens when a photographer is doing the right things.  Congratulations!  One of my top 10 favorites of this challenge.', '2005-07-18 18:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544493, 202727, 30817, '<td valign="top">Seems like I''ve seen this shot 100 times, but it always impresses me.  Real excellent timing for a shot not as easy as some may think.</td>', 'Seems like I''ve seen this shot 100 times, but it always impresses me.  Real excellent timing for a shot not as easy as some may think.', '2005-07-18 18:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544507, 203158, 30817, '<td valign="top">Not an easy sport to capture in spirit, but you did it with this shot!  Nice to see a bowling shot with this much impact without including a bowler in a hand-up, follow-through position.  Very creative and perfectly timed.  One of my top 10 favorites of this week''s open challenge.</td>', 'Not an easy sport to capture in spirit, but you did it with this shot!  Nice to see a bowling shot with this much impact without including a bowler in a hand-up, follow-through position.  Very creative and perfectly timed.  One of my top 10 favorites of this week''s open challenge.', '2005-07-18 18:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544525, 202739, 30817, '<td valign="top">I feel this is the best futebol shot of the week.  The players in synch above the ground is stunning.  One of my top 10 favorites for this challenge.  One question ... did you pick this title because you thought this shot was about the grass or just afraid someone might miss the turf flying around?  No chance of the latter.</td>', 'I feel this is the best futebol shot of the week.  The players in synch above the ground is stunning.  One of my top 10 favorites for this challenge.  One question ... did you pick this title because you thought this shot was about the grass or just afraid someone might miss the turf flying around?  No chance of the latter.', '2005-07-18 18:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544535, 203031, 30817, '<td valign="top">Receiving one of my highest scores for this challenge, this image is exquisitely rendered.  The position of the horse, its straining neck, the determination of the rider''s bearing all add to a truly interest generating composition and the hat is the icing on the cake!</td>', 'Receiving one of my highest scores for this challenge, this image is exquisitely rendered.  The position of the horse, its straining neck, the determination of the rider''s bearing all add to a truly interest generating composition and the hat is the icing on the cake!', '2005-07-18 18:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544538, 203093, 30817, '<td valign="top">Poetry is giving the most information with the fewest words.  This photograph is a poem.  One of my top 10 favorites of this challenge, it received one of my highest votes.</td>', 'Poetry is giving the most information with the fewest words.  This photograph is a poem.  One of my top 10 favorites of this challenge, it received one of my highest votes.', '2005-07-18 18:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544543, 202634, 30817, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites to ribbon this week, this is a story in and of itself!  What a great amount of patience you must have displayed to get this shot.  Congratulations!</td>', 'One of my favorites to ribbon this week, this is a story in and of itself!  What a great amount of patience you must have displayed to get this shot.  Congratulations!', '2005-07-18 18:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544546, 202870, 30817, '<td valign="top">"He''s escaping!"  This is one of my picks to ribbon this week. Your timing was so fine and the composition is just terrific!  The position in relationship to the fence is just brilliant .... bravo!</td>', '"He''s escaping!"  This is one of my picks to ribbon this week. Your timing was so fine and the composition is just terrific!  The position in relationship to the fence is just brilliant .... bravo!', '2005-07-18 18:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544556, 201619, 30817, '<td valign="top">This windsurfing shot got aced out on my ballot by another windsurfer, but only by a point ... and because it was my top pick ... but second place ain''t bad!  This is truly a great shot of a tough sport to get in focus, in frame and on time.  You did it all here and I applaud you.  One of my top 10 picks of this challenge.</td>', 'This windsurfing shot got aced out on my ballot by another windsurfer, but only by a point ... and because it was my top pick ... but second place ain''t bad!  This is truly a great shot of a tough sport to get in focus, in frame and on time.  You did it all here and I applaud you.  One of my top 10 picks of this challenge.', '2005-07-18 19:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544590, 202685, 38725, '<td valign="top">great silhouette</td>', 'great silhouette', '2005-07-18 19:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544606, 203031, 40204, '<td valign="top">The rider looks like she is in the horses mouth too much.</td>', 'The rider looks like she is in the horses mouth too much.', '2005-07-18 19:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544663, 203196, 40204, '<td valign="top">The rider would ride better if she relaxes. Trust me I ride.</td>', 'The rider would ride better if she relaxes. Trust me I ride.', '2005-07-18 20:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544718, 203173, 34836, '<td valign="top">i''m not a big fan of B&amp;W but you really did a good job with this one.  The grain adds to the feel of the picture.  The emotion of the ump is great and I love the veins popping out on his arms.</td>', 'i''m not a big fan of B&W but you really did a good job with this one.  The grain adds to the feel of the picture.  The emotion of the ump is great and I love the veins popping out on his arms.', '2005-07-18 20:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544725, 202183, 34836, '<td valign="top">Great affect.  If he was going downhill, I would have thought about rotating him straight.  If he was going straight, I wouldn''t have tilted it.  I feel the tilt takes away from the suggested speed of the biker.  Nice picture though.  I like it.</td>', 'Great affect.  If he was going downhill, I would have thought about rotating him straight.  If he was going straight, I wouldn''t have tilted it.  I feel the tilt takes away from the suggested speed of the biker.  Nice picture though.  I like it.', '2005-07-18 20:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544730, 202993, 34836, '<td valign="top">The tilt is unnatural.  I don''t think it adds anything to this picture.  Good capture though.</td>', 'The tilt is unnatural.  I don''t think it adds anything to this picture.  Good capture though.', '2005-07-18 20:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544736, 202644, 34836, '<td valign="top">Who could think that badmiton would make a good photo.  Go figure.  This is just great.  It''s got emotion, action, and totally squashes the stereotype of the game.  Great job.  I think this is a winner.</td>', 'Who could think that badmiton would make a good photo.  Go figure.  This is just great.  It''s got emotion, action, and totally squashes the stereotype of the game.  Great job.  I think this is a winner.', '2005-07-18 20:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544739, 202541, 34836, '<td valign="top">Too bad he stopped to cover his eyes.  It would have been better if you got a climbing shot.  Great view though.  I like the composition.</td>', 'Too bad he stopped to cover his eyes.  It would have been better if you got a climbing shot.  Great view though.  I like the composition.', '2005-07-18 20:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544746, 203168, 34836, '<td valign="top">Too centered.  An angled shot would have given a little more depth to the picture.  Nice vantage point though.</td>', 'Too centered.  An angled shot would have given a little more depth to the picture.  Nice vantage point though.', '2005-07-18 21:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544752, 203283, 33672, '<td valign="top">I remember when Wayne Rainey rode and won for Kawi! Thanks for jogging my memory and a great action photo that''s crisp and well composed...</td>', 'I remember when Wayne Rainey rode and won for Kawi! Thanks for jogging my memory and a great action photo that''s crisp and well composed...', '2005-07-18 21:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544754, 202175, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great comp where the soft focus actually works.</td>', 'Great comp where the soft focus actually works.', '2005-07-18 21:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544784, 202950, 33583, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot! I love the contrasts.</td>', 'Awesome shot! I love the contrasts.', '2005-07-18 21:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544840, 202359, 38476, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Great capture!</td>', 'Great shot! Great capture!', '2005-07-18 21:29:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1544874, 202435, 18644, '<td valign="top">Tu auras pas grand choses avec celle la, c''est platte :)<br/>salut la francophonie (tu as des points pour çca de ma part)</td>', 'Tu auras pas grand choses avec celle la, c''est platte :)salut la francophonie (tu as des points pour çca de ma part)', '2005-07-18 21:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544909, 202536, 18644, '<td valign="top">That''s called fishing for challenge :)<br/></td>', 'That''s called fishing for challenge :)', '2005-07-18 21:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544916, 201796, 18644, '<td valign="top">Fishing to meet the challenge maybe :)</td>', 'Fishing to meet the challenge maybe :)', '2005-07-18 21:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544928, 201754, 18644, '<td valign="top">Hunting to meet the chellenge ;) almost there.</td>', 'Hunting to meet the chellenge ;) almost there.', '2005-07-18 21:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545062, 202637, 37524, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast of the rock and the yellow ball.</td>', 'I love the contrast of the rock and the yellow ball.', '2005-07-18 22:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545078, 201095, 34396, '<td valign="top">Photo is very small.  Using the full allowed size available 640 pixels will give voters a better chance to evaluate your work.  As it is, it looks over-exposed, or under-exposed since it is a negative image.  I can''t see what it has to do with a sport or whale watching for that matter.  Sorry, 2</td>', 'Photo is very small.  Using the full allowed size available 640 pixels will give voters a better chance to evaluate your work.  As it is, it looks over-exposed, or under-exposed since it is a negative image.  I can''t see what it has to do with a sport or whale watching for that matter.  Sorry, 2', '2005-07-18 23:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545085, 203093, 34396, '<td valign="top">I personally do not care for grainy photos.  I also think the photo could use a bit more contrast.  The boxer''s arm blends into the brick too much.</td>', 'I personally do not care for grainy photos.  I also think the photo could use a bit more contrast.  The boxer''s arm blends into the brick too much.', '2005-07-18 23:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545090, 202209, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very ''cool'' capture. Happy landing!<br/></td>', 'A very ''cool'' capture. Happy landing!', '2005-07-18 23:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545093, 202426, 22734, '<td valign="top">As cool as it gets.</td>', 'As cool as it gets.', '2005-07-18 23:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545096, 202638, 22734, '<td valign="top">The simple pleasures unless the wind get to 15 knots. lol Nice capture.</td>', 'The simple pleasures unless the wind get to 15 knots. lol Nice capture.', '2005-07-18 23:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545097, 203146, 22734, '<td valign="top">Truly a breathtaking image.</td>', 'Truly a breathtaking image.', '2005-07-18 23:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545099, 201846, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great action shot with good height.</td>', 'Great action shot with good height.', '2005-07-18 23:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545100, 202337, 22734, '<td valign="top">A critical moment with classic pose of the swing.</td>', 'A critical moment with classic pose of the swing.', '2005-07-18 23:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545101, 201326, 22734, '<td valign="top">These kids are amazing. Good action capture.</td>', 'These kids are amazing. Good action capture.', '2005-07-18 23:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
