(1545656, 201466, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - DMC - No action.  Nice picture of a green nestled in trees but - that is not what you were challenged to do.</td>', '2 - DMC - No action.  Nice picture of a green nestled in trees but - that is not what you were challenged to do.', '2005-07-19 06:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545657, 201382, 38476, '<td valign="top">Good photo. I like the dramatic poses &amp; I think your choice of black &amp; white is great. My only complaints are the distance of your subject to the camera (I think this would have been great if we could see the details of his face much clearer) &amp; the deterioration of the image (especially around his shoulder &amp; neck).<br/> <br/>You''ve got a great eye for photography, though. The wall &amp; steps (assuming you deliberately chose this setting!) make a great frame for the couple, and, I can''t get over what a good choice black &amp; white was. Excllent job!</td>', 'Good photo. I like the dramatic poses & I think your choice of black & white is great. My only complaints are the distance of your subject to the camera (I think this would have been great if we could see the details of his face much clearer) & the deterioration of the image (especially around his shoulder & neck). You''ve got a great eye for photography, though. The wall & steps (assuming you deliberately chose this setting!) make a great frame for the couple, and, I can''t get over what a good choice black & white was. Excllent job!', '2005-07-19 06:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545662, 203238, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - DMC - No action here.  Why not take a shot of the action when you are at a sports field.  Just the bottom of the legs is not very ''brave''.</td>', '2 - DMC - No action here.  Why not take a shot of the action when you are at a sports field.  Just the bottom of the legs is not very ''brave''.', '2005-07-19 07:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
