(1547502, 202209, 22459, '<td valign="top">I love the clear crisp sharpness of this image catching the surfer at the height of the wave in stop action is fantastic. <br/>You have also managed to catch great detail in the face allowing the viewer to see the concentration in the surfer and with the extended right arm and fingers which really  highlights the sense of balance required.<br/>Well done on a great "sports action shot".</td>', 'I love the clear crisp sharpness of this image catching the surfer at the height of the wave in stop action is fantastic. You have also managed to catch great detail in the face allowing the viewer to see the concentration in the surfer and with the extended right arm and fingers which really  highlights the sense of balance required.Well done on a great "sports action shot".', '2005-07-19 20:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
