(1547751, 202897, 40386, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a bit flat, typical of the coast.  A bit of a closer crop would have given it more impact</td>', 'Lighting is a bit flat, typical of the coast.  A bit of a closer crop would have given it more impact', '2005-07-19 21:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1547753, 201925, 40386, '<td valign="top">Highlights and shadows are a bit too extreme, washed out highlights and dark shadows which hides the horses eye.  This would have been better if the face was in better light and you could see the horses eye maybe?</td>', 'Highlights and shadows are a bit too extreme, washed out highlights and dark shadows which hides the horses eye.  This would have been better if the face was in better light and you could see the horses eye maybe?', '2005-07-19 21:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1547754, 203199, 37334, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. Nice soft tones.</td>', 'I really like this one. Nice soft tones.', '2005-07-19 21:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1547758, 201763, 40386, '<td valign="top">This was shot with the photographer looking towards the sun and therefore the children are very dark shadows.  This would have been a better picture if you had done it from the other side of the pool with the sun behind you and the light on the children</td>', 'This was shot with the photographer looking towards the sun and therefore the children are very dark shadows.  This would have been a better picture if you had done it from the other side of the pool with the sun behind you and the light on the children', '2005-07-19 21:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1547761, 202228, 40386, '<td valign="top">The motion blur doesnt do it for me in this shot.  Also too much space behind the subject it looks out of balance</td>', 'The motion blur doesnt do it for me in this shot.  Also too much space behind the subject it looks out of balance', '2005-07-19 21:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1547768, 202971, 40386, '<td valign="top">Tius shot looks too washed out and has a lot of noise from trying to lighten a dark picture I assume.  A bit more contrast and density might improve it.</td>', 'Tius shot looks too washed out and has a lot of noise from trying to lighten a dark picture I assume.  A bit more contrast and density might improve it.', '2005-07-19 21:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1547772, 203027, 40386, '<td valign="top">This would have been a better shot if you had left less space behind the subject hitting the ball and had more of the net and opposing team in the shot.  Easy for this to happen when you are trying to focus using the center point in your camera.</td>', 'This would have been a better shot if you had left less space behind the subject hitting the ball and had more of the net and opposing team in the shot.  Easy for this to happen when you are trying to focus using the center point in your camera.', '2005-07-19 21:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1547775, 203034, 40386, '<td valign="top">A bit more density/contrast would have made this a better shotand given it a bit more punch, it looks a bit washed out and slightly out of focus.</td>', 'A bit more density/contrast would have made this a better shotand given it a bit more punch, it looks a bit washed out and slightly out of focus.', '2005-07-19 22:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
