(1549321, 202337, 38889, '<td valign="top">According to your comment you took this in one shot (no burst). That''s the kind of training I would love to get. Though I am interested in other type of sports the idea of single shot is amazing. Good work. Congrats on the top 20!</td>', 'According to your comment you took this in one shot (no burst). That''s the kind of training I would love to get. Though I am interested in other type of sports the idea of single shot is amazing. Good work. Congrats on the top 20!', '2005-07-20 07:33:42.000000', NULL, 0),
