(1549330, 202315, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is one of those images that''s just crying for some photog notes...ya know, like, HOW DID YOU GET THIS SHOT?!?!?!<br/> <br/>congrats on the top-20!</td>', 'this is one of those images that''s just crying for some photog notes...ya know, like, HOW DID YOU GET THIS SHOT?!?!?! congrats on the top-20!', '2005-07-20 07:46:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1549331, 202619, 25655, '<td valign="top">So dissapointing to see the results on the challenge and see this great image where it is.<br/>At least 60% of the photos finished in higher places shouldn''t be there at all for the "Not fit the challenge" reason.<br/>Well, I guess we already learned what people really understand on the matter ;-)<br/>This still is a wonderful picture and a personal favorite of mine.<br/>I thank you for it so much!<br/></td>', 'So dissapointing to see the results on the challenge and see this great image where it is.At least 60% of the photos finished in higher places shouldn''t be there at all for the "Not fit the challenge" reason.Well, I guess we already learned what people really understand on the matter ;-)This still is a wonderful picture and a personal favorite of mine.I thank you for it so much!', '2005-07-20 07:46:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1549336, 201954, 16493, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for commenting and voting.<br/>Special thanks to everyone who picked this image as a Favorit. (hint)<br/> <br/>Nice to have a new personal best but int only a 0.03 over my naked self. Yes, you can all take a look at my profile but you have been warrned, I just made an ass out of my self there.<br/> <br/>Well, thanks again, at least I can now just smell the ribbons...<br/> <br/>Just wanted to add:<br/>This sport competition was so much more than just a normal competition. A group of us desided to beat Arnit at his own game and show him how to take great action sport photos. Looks like i''m one of them that could not show him how.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-20 06:52:45.</i></td>', 'Thanks everyone for commenting and voting.Special thanks to everyone who picked this image as a Favorit. (hint) Nice to have a new personal best but int only a 0.03 over my naked self. Yes, you can all take a look at my profile but you have been warrned, I just made an ass out of my self there. Well, thanks again, at least I can now just smell the ribbons... Just wanted to add:This sport competition was so much more than just a normal competition. A group of us desided to beat Arnit at his own game and show him how to take great action sport photos. Looks like i''m one of them that could not show him how.', '2005-07-20 07:48:58.000000', '2005-07-20 07:52:45.000000', 0),
(1549352, 201979, 23394, '<td valign="top">great finish for your first time out!  and with a nice shot, as well.<br/> <br/>i think this would have done better for you if you had straightened up your horizon and cropped in as tight as possible.  it''s not easy to do this in an action shot (you''re pretty much having to shoot in a photojournalistic style).  good eye, good capture--keep it up!</td>', 'great finish for your first time out!  and with a nice shot, as well. i think this would have done better for you if you had straightened up your horizon and cropped in as tight as possible.  it''s not easy to do this in an action shot (you''re pretty much having to shoot in a photojournalistic style).  good eye, good capture--keep it up!', '2005-07-20 07:54:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(1549356, 202739, 16493, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your second ribbon.<br/>Now you only need the yellow to compleat the series.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-20 06:57:00.</i></td>', 'Congratulations on your second ribbon.Now you only need the yellow to compleat the series.', '2005-07-20 07:56:39.000000', '2005-07-20 07:57:00.000000', 0),
(1549364, 202997, 35355, '<td valign="top">Well done! Good to see that the Vaux family pastime scored so well!</td>', 'Well done! Good to see that the Vaux family pastime scored so well!', '2005-07-20 07:58:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(1549383, 203260, 23394, '<td valign="top">i scored this an 8, and would have expected it to score much higher.  maybe if you had rotated to straighten it up on a bit, and cropped in a little tighter.  all the same, i thought you nailed the challenge.</td>', 'i scored this an 8, and would have expected it to score much higher.  maybe if you had rotated to straighten it up on a bit, and cropped in a little tighter.  all the same, i thought you nailed the challenge.', '2005-07-20 08:03:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1549390, 202789, 25355, '<td valign="top">That''s incredible - they''re the same three players as in larus''s shot, just a fraction of a second later. Same exploding grass, too.</td>', 'That''s incredible - they''re the same three players as in larus''s shot, just a fraction of a second later. Same exploding grass, too.', '2005-07-20 08:05:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1549394, 201957, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice capture, ray!  yeah, we both know you were asking a bit too much out of that lens...i know of a mint condition 300mm f/2.8 that retails for $3700 that can be had for about a grand less--any interest?<br/> <br/>it does appear that you did well with those who stopped long enough to comment; my guess is that the detail you lost from the cropping is what did you in in the end.  valiant effort, though!</td>', 'nice capture, ray!  yeah, we both know you were asking a bit too much out of that lens...i know of a mint condition 300mm f/2.8 that retails for $3700 that can be had for about a grand less--any interest? it does appear that you did well with those who stopped long enough to comment; my guess is that the detail you lost from the cropping is what did you in in the end.  valiant effort, though!', '2005-07-20 08:07:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1549430, 202744, 27812, '<td valign="top">Again I will say this... this is a true action pic and extremely well captured. Remember we shoot for our own development and pleasure. The crowds'' opinions should be less important. Sad to see this pic so far down the line though.</td>', 'Again I will say this... this is a true action pic and extremely well captured. Remember we shoot for our own development and pleasure. The crowds'' opinions should be less important. Sad to see this pic so far down the line though.', '2005-07-20 08:26:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1549432, 202337, 27605, '<td valign="top">Yeah I''m one of your ONE voters.... NOT!  What a joke is right :o)  Great shot, congrats on the great score and personal best!</td>', 'Yeah I''m one of your ONE voters.... NOT!  What a joke is right :o)  Great shot, congrats on the great score and personal best!', '2005-07-20 08:27:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1549445, 203119, 15026, '<td valign="top">I guess people do not appreciate the difficulty involved in this shot.  I had you much, much higher (gave you one of only a couple 9''s in this challenge).  You were robbed!</td>', 'I guess people do not appreciate the difficulty involved in this shot.  I had you much, much higher (gave you one of only a couple 9''s in this challenge).  You were robbed!', '2005-07-20 08:40:26.000000', NULL, 0),
