(1550992, 202870, 36297, '<td valign="top">Thank you guys!!<br/>It is not fake, people do that kind of things, I sent the original file too to prove that.<br/> <br/>Thanks again for all the nice words and voting!</td>', 'Thank you guys!!It is not fake, people do that kind of things, I sent the original file too to prove that. Thanks again for all the nice words and voting!', '2005-07-20 17:49:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(1551035, 202870, 23653, '<td valign="top">Do you shot this type of stuff for a living, its great.  added to my favorites.<br/> <br/>Ty</td>', 'Do you shot this type of stuff for a living, its great.  added to my favorites. Ty', '2005-07-20 18:05:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1551159, 203119, 24454, '<td valign="top">I agree. . .I have tried so manytimes to get this kind of shot.  This is amazing.   6.1 isn''t a bad score, but I would think it would score a lot higher too.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I agree. . .I have tried so manytimes to get this kind of shot.  This is amazing.   6.1 isn''t a bad score, but I would think it would score a lot higher too. ', '2005-07-20 18:51:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1551170, 202315, 280, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all the people who took the time to vote and comment! As for how I got this shot, there was nothing that special on my part, most of it was due to the location. This shot hopefully gives you a better impression of how the shot was taken - <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=206831" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=206831</a> - I was simply stood on the top of a hill above where the paragliders were taking off, giving me a view of the far side of the valley with the paragliders in the line of fire.</td>', 'Thanks to all the people who took the time to vote and comment! As for how I got this shot, there was nothing that special on my part, most of it was due to the location. This shot hopefully gives you a better impression of how the shot was taken - //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=206831 - I was simply stood on the top of a hill above where the paragliders were taking off, giving me a view of the far side of the valley with the paragliders in the line of fire.', '2005-07-20 18:55:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1551315, 203163, 34906, '<td valign="top">I really love this shot and I''m sorry to hear that you will stop having fun in order to get higher scores.  It''s one of the hazards of a competetive site, though - in the end we have to do what pleases ourselves.  If the competetive urge trumps serendipity and spontaneity, that''s what we need to do.  I don''t know if this makes any sense, I''m working on my second martini.;)</td>', 'I really love this shot and I''m sorry to hear that you will stop having fun in order to get higher scores.  It''s one of the hazards of a competetive site, though - in the end we have to do what pleases ourselves.  If the competetive urge trumps serendipity and spontaneity, that''s what we need to do.  I don''t know if this makes any sense, I''m working on my second martini.;)', '2005-07-20 20:03:45.000000', NULL, 0),
