(1552352, 202739, 23858, '<td valign="top">My entry was also from this same game, and I can vouch for Larus and Andri that they were indeed both taking pictures side by side at the game - I was there with them for the first half and at the other end of the field for the second half, when these photographs were shot.<br/> <br/>All in all, I think there were 6 if not 7 DPC''ers at the game - at least. The reason is probably that we don´t have that many sport events here in Iceland during the timeframe of a week, except for football. This match was by far the most prestigious one during that week as the two teams are the two largest/most successful teams in Reykjavik, the capital city(and only city I might add ;).<br/> <br/>p.s: Til hamingju með borðann kvikindið þitt ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-21 08:05:32.</i></td>', 'My entry was also from this same game, and I can vouch for Larus and Andri that they were indeed both taking pictures side by side at the game - I was there with them for the first half and at the other end of the field for the second half, when these photographs were shot. All in all, I think there were 6 if not 7 DPC''ers at the game - at least. The reason is probably that we don´t have that many sport events here in Iceland during the timeframe of a week, except for football. This match was by far the most prestigious one during that week as the two teams are the two largest/most successful teams in Reykjavik, the capital city(and only city I might add ;). p.s: Til hamingju með borðann kvikindið þitt ;)', '2005-07-21 09:05:05.000000', '2005-07-21 09:05:32.000000', 0),
