(1616181, 203276, 27763, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice composition.  I like the arc of the wheel/tire and I like that the spokes are not visible.  Great job.</td>', 'This is a really nice composition.  I like the arc of the wheel/tire and I like that the spokes are not visible.  Great job.', '2005-08-17 00:41:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1624002, 200899, 18932, '<td valign="top">As others have said a bit too busy, the sharpness and subject are very good. To improve either crop or have a shallow depth of field so the background is blurred. Perhaps if this were a bit less bright people would have scored this slightly better too, IMHO. Good first challenge, stick around, you''ll learn hraps.</td>', 'As others have said a bit too busy, the sharpness and subject are very good. To improve either crop or have a shallow depth of field so the background is blurred. Perhaps if this were a bit less bright people would have scored this slightly better too, IMHO. Good first challenge, stick around, you''ll learn hraps.', '2005-08-19 14:26:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1650170, 203209, 38267, '<td valign="top">Good sports shot.  I think the composition, focus, and fence background are all really nice.  The color looks a little flat, but it was probably taken during the middle of a bright sunny day.</td>', 'Good sports shot.  I think the composition, focus, and fence background are all really nice.  The color looks a little flat, but it was probably taken during the middle of a bright sunny day.', '2005-08-27 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1665278, 202619, 36429, '<td valign="top">That Has to hurt! Maybe a I would have composed more on the white-robed player. Very nice action.</td>', 'That Has to hurt! Maybe a I would have composed more on the white-robed player. Very nice action.', '2005-09-01 07:52:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(1673324, 202869, 36429, '<td valign="top">Personally I would have cropped tighter on the left, so the horse''s tail points to the bottom left corner of the frame, but that is only a nitpick on an excellent action shot!</td>', 'Personally I would have cropped tighter on the left, so the horse''s tail points to the bottom left corner of the frame, but that is only a nitpick on an excellent action shot!', '2005-09-04 18:22:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1673384, 202869, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wow - that dust (cough cough) - I can almost smell it. Great stop action. I love all the natural colors. From an artistic point of view, I might crop some on the left to bring the horse a little to the left, but still showcase the cattle on the right.</td>', 'Wow - that dust (cough cough) - I can almost smell it. Great stop action. I love all the natural colors. From an artistic point of view, I might crop some on the left to bring the horse a little to the left, but still showcase the cattle on the right.', '2005-09-04 19:09:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1679759, 202209, 39696, '<td valign="top">Thats an amazing photograph.. how did you take it?</td>', 'Thats an amazing photograph.. how did you take it?', '2005-09-06 18:59:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1700366, 203260, 44099, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but the background is very distracting. Would''ve been better if cropped tighter and maybe a little more blur in the background.</td>', 'Nice capture, but the background is very distracting. Would''ve been better if cropped tighter and maybe a little more blur in the background.', '2005-09-12 17:53:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1714579, 202365, 42681, '<td valign="top">Great shot it looks like they are really flying.  Some post processing would really help this shot pop.<br/> <br/>GG</td>', 'Great shot it looks like they are really flying.  Some post processing would really help this shot pop. GG', '2005-09-16 17:17:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1751841, 203078, 25959, '<td valign="top">No blur on ball that I can detect. Background figure seems to be looking down... Ball just does not look like it is in play. Also very flat lighting. (Could have been dropped into frame by an assistant, I suppose) Ergo, I suspect photoshop editing. My experience: 30 plus years playing tennis badly and taking photos (also badly) of tennis playing chums.</td>', 'No blur on ball that I can detect. Background figure seems to be looking down... Ball just does not look like it is in play. Also very flat lighting. (Could have been dropped into frame by an assistant, I suppose) Ergo, I suspect photoshop editing. My experience: 30 plus years playing tennis badly and taking photos (also badly) of tennis playing chums.', '2005-10-01 06:46:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1770138, 202666, 41200, '<td valign="top">Nice color, crop, and DOF.</td>', 'Nice color, crop, and DOF.', '2005-10-08 14:38:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1801439, 202685, 26255, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!!</td>', 'Great shot!!!', '2005-10-21 16:21:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1822697, 202619, 24486, '<td valign="top">Doc, I can look at this &amp; feel the energy coming out of the particpants. I am absolutly shocked by the placing you recieved for this composition. I would have placed this one much much higher in the rankings but you just never know what pleases DPCers at times.</td>', 'Doc, I can look at this & feel the energy coming out of the particpants. I am absolutly shocked by the placing you recieved for this composition. I would have placed this one much much higher in the rankings but you just never know what pleases DPCers at times.', '2005-10-29 07:55:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1823770, 202040, 14986, '<td valign="top">What an awesome shot!  This is one of the biggest limitations of my 717 - not good at all for action shots.  You''ve really captured the moment here with the water, the colors and the stopped action.   The only thing I would like better is if we could see more of the face and expression of the person.</td>', 'What an awesome shot!  This is one of the biggest limitations of my 717 - not good at all for action shots.  You''ve really captured the moment here with the water, the colors and the stopped action.   The only thing I would like better is if we could see more of the face and expression of the person.', '2005-10-29 22:24:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1845880, 202671, 34659, '<td valign="top">Fantastic processing here.  Great composition, focus, lighting, etc.  The cars in the background are a bit of a distraction, but not much you can do about that!  :-)  Great shot.</td>', 'Fantastic processing here.  Great composition, focus, lighting, etc.  The cars in the background are a bit of a distraction, but not much you can do about that!  :-)  Great shot.', '2005-11-07 20:41:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1890253, 203062, 37740, '<td valign="top">A very non-typical photo from what I can see in you current portfolio. Composition is great, but I think you might have over exposed af bit.</td>', 'A very non-typical photo from what I can see in you current portfolio. Composition is great, but I think you might have over exposed af bit.', '2005-11-22 19:19:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1915978, 202727, 48955, '<td valign="top">Nice pic. Anyhow, just wanna know how the 300mm f/4 lense responded to D70 when u took this shot: -<br/> <br/>1. Did you set to Continuous 3f/s or it was just a single shot, &amp; was it set to Dynamic AF or etc. <br/>2. Did u use a tripod for this shot?<br/> <br/>By looking at the shot, I would say that the sharpness was at the rider\''s helmet (see the red stripe) &amp; not at his sunglasses.<br/>Just think about to get this lense for my collection... if it is good.<br/>Thanks</td>', 'Nice pic. Anyhow, just wanna know how the 300mm f/4 lense responded to D70 when u took this shot: - 1. Did you set to Continuous 3f/s or it was just a single shot, & was it set to Dynamic AF or etc. 2. Did u use a tripod for this shot? By looking at the shot, I would say that the sharpness was at the rider\''s helmet (see the red stripe) & not at his sunglasses.Just think about to get this lense for my collection... if it is good.Thanks', '2005-12-02 11:36:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1921646, 201086, 34659, '<td valign="top">Sorry about the DQ...  I scored this an 8.  It''s really terrific!  The selective desat works sooo well.  Great job.</td>', 'Sorry about the DQ...  I scored this an 8.  It''s really terrific!  The selective desat works sooo well.  Great job.', '2005-12-04 18:46:10.000000', NULL, 0),
