(2530278, 203119, 58785, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot... I would like to share my hits also if you don''t mind. Unfortunately Panasonic LZ2 is a slower machine, so couldn''t catch the impact moment ;) Maybe with my new Pentax *istDL one day :)<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=339666" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Home Run</a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=340120" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Enhanced Base Hit</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by drewmedia - ..</i></td>', 'Very cool shot... I would like to share my hits also if you don''t mind. Unfortunately Panasonic LZ2 is a slower machine, so couldn''t catch the impact moment ;) Maybe with my new Pentax *istDL one day :) Home Run Enhanced Base HitMessage edited by drewmedia - ..', '2006-06-19 22:51:19.000000', NULL, 0),
