(2841344, 202789, 22543, '<td valign="top">This is... probably the most spectacular shot that i have ever seen of soccer. I mean, i have seen great action like this, but this also has spot on sharpness and focus, and great depth of field. Wonderful job man. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-16 20:15:48.</i></td>', 'This is... probably the most spectacular shot that i have ever seen of soccer. I mean, i have seen great action like this, but this also has spot on sharpness and focus, and great depth of field. Wonderful job man. ', '2006-09-16 21:14:42.000000', '2006-09-16 21:15:48.000000', 0),
(3107623, 201981, 3214, '<td valign="top">Completely precious.  And I love the 3rd baseman left in for context. Go, Emily!<br/></td>', 'Completely precious.  And I love the 3rd baseman left in for context. Go, Emily!', '2006-12-11 20:16:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3299789, 200899, 48389, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and detail here but as is mentioned below the background is a little busy. Maybe by using a larger aperture (small number) and creating a shallower depth of field you could have blurred some of the background and had the viewers eye more concentrated on the batsman (?) :o)</td>', 'I like the lighting and detail here but as is mentioned below the background is a little busy. Maybe by using a larger aperture (small number) and creating a shallower depth of field you could have blurred some of the background and had the viewers eye more concentrated on the batsman (?) :o)', '2007-01-29 17:04:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3302471, 200899, 54228, '<td valign="top">This is great! I too think the background is a little busy, but changing that would mean removing the guys in the box on the second flaw, who really add another element to this shot. Then again, it would also have been nice to see more of the batter''s expression, I wonder what the original looks like at full size?</td>', 'This is great! I too think the background is a little busy, but changing that would mean removing the guys in the box on the second flaw, who really add another element to this shot. Then again, it would also have been nice to see more of the batter''s expression, I wonder what the original looks like at full size?', '2007-01-30 09:57:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3330514, 200899, 70828, '<td valign="top">Great capture ... ball in the shot ... observers reaction ... perfect timing ... exposure good ... but PLEASE make your shots to the 640 pixel maximum on the longer side so we can see the detail.</td>', 'Great capture ... ball in the shot ... observers reaction ... perfect timing ... exposure good ... but PLEASE make your shots to the 640 pixel maximum on the longer side so we can see the detail.', '2007-02-05 12:06:10.000000', NULL, 0),
